OL,3,GNEWSALondon's only 24-hour hospital
OL,4,Ahelipad marks a decade of saving lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the team you never want to meet.
OL,8,FThey assemble on the roof of King's
OL,9,FCollege Hospital in Denmark Hill to
OL,10,Freceive the most critically ill
OL,11,Fpatients, with a trauma nurse, a
OL,12,Fhelideck security officer and a
OL,13,Fspecially trained porter among them.
OL,15,FThe people they care for, who arrive by
OL,16,Fhelicopter, have suffered road traffic
OL,17,Faccidents, falls, strokes and heart
OL,18,Fattacks.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
