OL,3,GNEWSALondon's only 24-hour hospital
OL,4,Ahelipad marks a decade of saving lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut since the helideck at the south
OL,7,FLondon hospital opened 10 years ago,
OL,8,Fair transfers have given patients the
OL,9,Fbest chance of survival because, in
OL,10,Fmedical emergencies, every minute
OL,11,Fcounts.
